# Fable 5 can't tell you why

Bad. Fable 5, like every model anyone has measured, cannot reliably tell you why it did something. When you ask, it rereads its own output the way you would and writes a plausible story. The story is a guess. Psychology calls this confabulation, and humans do it too<Cite id="nisbett" />.

